## Tech Stack for the RAG System

| Component | Tool | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Python Web Framework | **FastAPI** | Async, streaming support, auto-docs |
| PDF Extraction | **PyMuPDF (fitz)** | Page-accurate, handles complex layouts |
| Chunking | **LangChain TextSplitter** | Battle-tested sentence-boundary chunking |
| Embedding Model | **Google text-embedding-004** | Free, 768-dim, excellent quality |
| Vector DB | **ChromaDB** | Local, zero-config, perfect for this scale |
| Re-Ranker | **sentence-transformers** | Local, free, no API key needed |
| LLM Orchestration | **LangGraph** | Production multi-agent state machine |
| LLM | **Gemini 1.5 Flash / Groq** | Free tiers, fast, streaming support |
| Node ↔ Python Bridge | **HTTP (axios)** | Simple, clean separation of concerns |

